93
00:07:04,880 --> 00:07:10,220
Kame...

94
00:07:10,220 --> 00:07:11,110
Ele ficou louco?

95
00:07:11,720 --> 00:07:14,120
ha...

96
00:07:16,430 --> 00:07:20,870
me...

97
00:07:23,560 --> 00:07:26,420
ha!

98
00:08:18,080 --> 00:08:20,310
Nuvem Voadora!

99
00:08:26,790 --> 00:08:27,750
Conseguimos!

100
