Estou bem aqui!

174
00:13:59,170 --> 00:14:01,040
<i>Mas quem é você?</i>

175
00:14:01,040 --> 00:14:03,090
Eu sou eu.

176
00:14:05,010 --> 00:14:06,590
Que barulho!

177
00:14:06,590 --> 00:14:08,840
Tem ideia de quem somos?

178
00:14:08,840 --> 00:14:11,240
<i>Quem?</i>

179
00:14:11,240 --> 00:14:14,020
<i>Comandante Red!</i>

180
00:14:14,020 --> 00:14:17,100
